OL,3,ASchools, GPs and businesses hit by
OL,4,Aglobal Microsoft outage as company
OL,5,Ascrambles to solve issue
OL,6,
OL,7,FA Microsoft outage is affecting
OL,8,Fservices including Teams, Outlook and
OL,9,FAI software Copilot - here's what we
OL,10,Fknow
OL,12,FA GP tells our correspondent "there
OL,13,Fwill be major problems NHS-wise";
OL,14,Fschools are reporting issues and ask
OL,15,Fparents to get in touch via phone not
OL,16,Femail; and UK Parliament says
OL,17,F"alternative communication arrangements
OL,18,Fare in place"
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
