OL,3,ASchools, GPs and businesses hit by
OL,4,Aglobal Microsoft outage as company
OL,5,Ascrambles to solve issue
OL,6,
OL,7,FHow are you affected? Ester, in
OL,8,FLancashire, says her team can't get any
OL,9,Fwork done and keep asking if they can
OL,10,Fgo home. Meanwhile, Martin says it was
OL,11,F"bliss" to wake up to no emails -
OL,12,Fbefore he realised "today is a crucial
OL,13,Fday to conclude a business deal"
OL,15,FThe outage started on Thursday, with
OL,16,Fmonitoring website Downdetector seeing
OL,17,Fproblems reported in more than 70
OL,18,Fcountries
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
