OL,3,ASchools, GPs and businesses hit by
OL,4,Aglobal Microsoft outage as company
OL,5,Ascrambles to solve issue
OL,6,
OL,7,FMicrosoft has said it's seeing "early
OL,8,Fsigns of stabilisation", but services
OL,9,Fhaven't "yet returned to normal".
OL,10,FEarlier, it said the issue wasn't
OL,11,Fcaused by a cyber-security breach
